                                                "sense_id": "97fedd19-d729-3fa8-be99-b0a5eb906631",
                                                "text": "She's from Czech, Croatia, or somewhere over there. The ill thing is that we always come together when we're drunk, but half way through our drunken talks, she always gets mad at something and leaves."
